---
import { page, asset } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Pop-up Stands" active="pop-up-stands">
   <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Popup Stands</span>

        <h1>Big <span>Impact</span>. Easy Setup</h1>

        <p>
          Professional pop-up stands for exhibitions, events and promotional spaces.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href={page('contact/')} class="hero-btn">
            Get a Quote
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <picture>
          <source media="(min-width:992px)" srcset={asset('assets/images/4.popup/hero.png')}>
          <img
            src={asset('assets/images/4.popup/hero-mobile.png')}
            alt="Professional promotional popup stands">
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-content">
   
   <section>
     <h2>Popup Stands</h2>
   
     <p>
       Popup stands are a versatile and professional exhibition
       display solution, designed to create impressive branded
       backdrops with minimal setup time. Combining 
       <strong>seamless graphics, lightweight construction,
       and modular flexibility</strong>, they provide an
       effective way to make your business stand out at
       exhibitions, trade shows, conferences, and promotional
       events.
     </p>
   
     <p>
       Our popup display systems are designed for convenience,
       with the complete framework and graphics packing neatly
       into a compact wheeled transport case. Once on-site,
       the expandable frame can be assembled quickly and
       easily, creating a substantial display area of up to
       approximately 2m x 3m, depending on the configuration.
       This makes popup stands particularly suitable for
       businesses that regularly attend events and require
       a reliable, reusable display solution.
     </p>
   
     <h3>Flexible Display Configurations</h3>
   
     <p>
       Available in a range of sizes, our popup stands feature
       both curved and flat frame options to accommodate
       different exhibition spaces and presentation styles.
       Individual stands can create attractive branded
       backdrops, while two or more compatible frames can
       be linked together to form larger display walls,
       exhibition environments, or complete presentation
       areas.
     </p>
   
     <p>
       Our magnet-to-magnet systems simplify installation,
       allowing graphic panels to be positioned accurately
       and securely. The result is a smooth, professional
       display that maximises your branding while keeping
       assembly and dismantling straightforward.
     </p>
   
     <h3>Accessories &amp; Display Enhancements</h3>
   
     <p>
       To help you create a more engaging exhibition space,
       we offer a selection of display accessories, including
       spotlights, monitor screens, iPad mounting solutions,
       and promotional counters with graphic wraps.
       These additions can enhance your presentation,
       showcase digital content, and provide practical
       spaces for interacting with visitors.
     </p>
   
     <p>
       Whether you need a simple promotional backdrop or
       a more comprehensive exhibition arrangement, our
       modular systems can be adapted to suit your available
       space, branding requirements, and event objectives.
     </p>
   
     <h3>Design &amp; Artwork Support</h3>
   
     <p>
       <strong>Need help bringing your exhibition display
       to life?</strong> Our in-house design and artwork
       service can help you create professional, eye-catching
       graphics that communicate your message effectively.
       We understand the importance of clear branding and
       visual impact, and can assist with preparing artwork
       that makes the most of your chosen display system.
     </p>
   
     <p>
       We supply a range of established exhibition display
       systems, including Abex, Brit, Eurostand, Neschen,
       Space, Skyline, and Ultima, providing solutions
       for a variety of exhibition requirements and budgets.
     </p>
   </section>


    <section class="row text-center image-content">
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/4.popup/image1.jpg')} alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference" />
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/4.popup/image2.jpg')} alt="Brand event display stand with promotional materials" />
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
